+// ---- Research-only instrumentation (experiments/minichain_matched). Inactive unless the
+// environment variables below are set; the DP itself is unchanged unless RECOMB_DP_GATE or
+// RECOMB_DP_TRUEDIST is set.
+//   RECOMB_DP_INDEX=<path>    dump each component's graph index once (after MPC_index)
+//   RECOMB_DP_DUMP=<path>     per read and component: input hash, DP-table hashes, best score
+//   RECOMB_DP_FULL=<n>        additionally dump full tables for the first n (read, component) pairs
